    "title": "MC Works Explosion 865HF",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>The MC WORKS Explosion series incorporates a medium elastic multi-ply structure enable a rod which is light, responsive and has a powerful backbone. Ideal for casting stickbaits and diving pencils, this series is designed for kingfish and tuna anglers.An all rounder model that withstands good power with a drag max of 12kg whilst being balanced and easy to use. An ideal rod for swimming stickbaits and diving pencils with the strength to fight fish from 5 ~ 20kgs.</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length: 8'6 ”</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Line: PE # 4-6</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Cast: 60-110g</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Drag max: 12kg</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Guide: Titanium Hybrid PMNSG + KWSG guide</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Code: #2204EXP865HFSTD</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Colourway: Black x titanium pin stripes &amp; pewter wrapping (butt section) &amp; gunmetal</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Handmade in Japan</span></p>",
